      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Pale-blue file list; file rows link to the setup or separate implementation handoff.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-architecture-preview\" aria-label=\"Architecture package\"><p class=\"ds-preview-title\">Review the architecture and build plan.</p><a class=\"ds-artifact-row\" href=\"start.html#describe-what-you-want-to-build\"><code>solution.drawio</code><span>Editable architecture views</span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-artifact-row\" href=\"start.html#describe-what-you-want-to-build\"><code>solution.md</code><span>Decisions and boundaries</span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-artifact-row\" href=\"start.html#describe-what-you-want-to-build\"><code>specification.md</code><span>Requirements and acceptance criteria</span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-artifact-row\" href=\"start.html#start-implementation-in-a-new-session\"><code>implementation-plan.md</code><span>Build steps in dependency order</span><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-architecture-preview{padding:32px;background:var(--c-wash,#eaf2ff);color:var(--c-heading,#032254);border:1px solid var(--c-tint,#dde6f7);border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Inter\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);line-height:1.7}.ds-preview-title{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 28px}.ds-artifact-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 20px;column-gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--c-tint,#dde6f7);color:var(--c-action,#0960c1);text-decoration:none}.ds-artifact-row code{display:block;color:var(--c-action,#0960c1);font-family:var(--font-mono,\"Cascadia Code\",ui-monospace,monospace);font-size:.88em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-artifact-row span{color:var(--c-heading,#032254);font-size:.88rem}.ds-artifact-row svg{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;align-self:center;color:var(--c-action,#0960c1)}.ds-artifact-row:hover{background:var(--c-tint,#dde6f7)}.ds-artifact-row:hover code{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}.ds-artifact-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--c-accent,#1a77e3);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:960px){.ds-architecture-preview{max-width:640px}}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-architecture-preview{padding:24px}}"
