      "html": "<h2 class=\"ds-section-heading\" id=\"work-in-your-own-repository\">Work in your own repository<a class=\"ds-heading-link\" href=\"#work-in-your-own-repository\" aria-label=\"Link to Work in your own repository\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m10 13 4-4M8 16l-1 1a4 4 0 0 1-6-6l4-4a4 4 0 0 1 6 0m2 1 1-1a4 4 0 0 1 6 6l-4 4a4 4 0 0 1-6 0\"/></svg></a></h2>",
